          "explanation": "The doctor reconciled the mismatch and converted it into a targeted verification task.",
          "quote": "建议请医生确认这次是否完整检查了双下肢深静脉"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by a specific mismatch in family understanding of the ultrasound wording. The doctor used the caregiver-provided wording, explained why arterial normality did not resolve venous thrombosis questions, and directed a precise bedside verification.",
