        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by a case-specific misconception that non-high-risk echo findings might mean PE was harmless or excluded. The doctor corrected it in plain language and linked the correction to continuing onsite treatment and avoiding self-stopping.",
